 ],
 "synopsis": "Travel tech firm Air IQ has confidentially filed draft papers with SEBI for an initial public offering to raise around Rs 1,000 crore. The offering comprises a mix of a fresh issue and an offer for sale, with the OFS accounting for roughly 60 percent of the issue. The promoters and promoter family will be selling a portion of their shares in the OFS, creating upcoming promoter liquidity. Pantomath Capital Advisors is acting as the sole book running lead manager for the IPO.",
